    old "It was comforting to think there was a strategy, a plan. And who was she to argue? Alaric had years of experience, compared to her few weeks."
    new "Era reconfortante pensar que existía una estrategia, un plan. ¿Y quién era ella para discutirlo? Aláric contaba con años de experiencia, en comparación con sus pocas semanas."

